:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Cafeteria Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Food Stall Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in the [[A Cultured Festival]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] increases health, damage, range and speed, and grants both [[Curse|Curse]] and [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]].

