==Trivia==
*Food Stall Cat is a reskin of [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Flower Cat]] with a different ability and target trait.
*The food that Food Stall Cat is preparing is [[wikipedia:Takoyaki|takoyaki]].
*Delivery Cat's description is missing the apostrophe in "it's".
*Delivery Cat's name and mention of Cat God in his description may be a reference to Matthew 6:13, "And lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from evil."
*The logo on Delivery Cat's packages is that of [https://www.kuronekoyamato.co.jp/ Yamato Transport], a Japanese door-to-door delivery company.
*Cafeteria Cat is based on the fact that in most Japanese schools, students will put on white coats and caps, then [[wikipedia:School lunch in Japan#Current|collect and deliver]] the school's lunches to their classrooms.

